cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MiniDiff: Detecting Logic Discrepancies in Cross-Layer Communications within Mini-Program Frameworks"
abstract: >-
  Source code and experimental data for MINIDIFF, an automated approach that
  synthesizes mini-programs from cross-layer communication building blocks and
  detects logic discrepancies across platforms and configurations of the WeChat,
  Alipay, and TikTok mini-program frameworks.
